[Cor BoundLimitingEntire of arXiv:2602.08739, '\large \bf MOMENTS OF C$\beta$E FIELD PARTITION FUNCTION, $\mathsf{Sine}_{\beta}$ CORRELAT'] Let $\beta,\delta>0$. For $r_1,\dots,r_\ell \in \mathbb{R}_+$ such that $\sum_{j=1}^\ell r_j \le2\delta$ we have,
\begin{equation}
\mathbb{E}\left[\left|\tilde{\boldsymbol{\xi}}^{\beta,\delta}(x_1)\right|^{r_1}\cdots \left|\tilde{\boldsymbol{\xi}}^{\beta,\delta}(x_\ell)\right|^{r_\ell}\right] \le C \prod_{j=1}^\ell \frac{1}{1+|x_j|^{(2\delta-\sum_{m=1}^\ell r_m)r_j/\beta}} \prod_{1\le i < j\le \ell} \frac{1}{1+|x_i-x_j|^{r_ir_j/\beta}},
\end{equation}
 where the constant $C > 0$ depends only on 
$\beta$, $\delta$, $\ell$ and $(r_m)_{1 \leq m \leq \ell}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

