[Defn StochasticZeta of arXiv:2602.08739, '\large \bf MOMENTS OF C$\beta$E FIELD PARTITION FUNCTION, $\mathsf{Sine}_{\beta}$ CORRELAT'] Let $\beta>0, \delta>0$. Define the following random entire function
\begin{equation}
\boldsymbol{\xi}^{\beta,\delta}(z)=\lim_{R\to \infty} \prod_{\substack{\mathsf{x} \in \mathcal{HP}_{\beta,\delta} \\ |\mathsf{x}|<R}} \left(1-\frac{z}{\mathsf{x}}\right).
