		\begin{equation*}
			D(\SCL, A) \defeq \inf\bigl\{t \ge 0: \SCB_t(\SCL) \cap A \neq \emptyset\bigr\}, 
		\end{equation*}
		and in particular $D(\SCL, z) \defeq D(\SCL, \{z\})$ for all $z \in \overline{\BD}$. Also write $\SCB_t(A)=\SCB_t(A;D)$ (resp.~$\SCB_t^-(A)=\SCB_t^-(A;D)$) for the closure of the union of $A$ and of the domains surrounded by $\SCL$ for $\SCL\in\Gamma$ with $D(\SCL,A)\le t$ (resp.~$D(\SCL,A)<t$). Then:
