[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2609.02610, 'The frame set of the first Hermite function'] Let $a,b \in (0, \infty)$. Then, 
  \begin{equation}
    \cG(h_1,a,b)\text{ is a frame}
    \quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad
    ab<1
    \quad\text{and}\quad
    ab\neq \frac{q-1}{q}
    \quad\text{for every }q\in\Z_{\geq2}.
  \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

