Then, the regularity of $g$ and $\rho$ together with the fact that $g'$ and $\rho$ do not vanish on $(a,b)$ show that $w_g'$ is piecewise continuous and thus $w_g$ is piecewise $\mathscr{C}^1$ on $(a,b)$. 

