[Proposition prop:2-sum inclu of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] Let $Q_1,\ldots,Q_n$ be positive definite quadratic forms on $V$, let $t_1,\ldots,t_n>0$ and write $Q:=t_1 Q_1+\cdots +t_nQ_n$ and $t:=t_1+\ldots+t_n$. Then we have 
  \begin{equation}
    \frac{t_1}{\sqrt{t}}B_{Q_1}^\circ+\cdots +\frac{t_n}{\sqrt{t}}B_{Q_n}^\circ\subset B^\circ_Q\subset\sqrt{t_1}B_{Q_1}^\circ+\cdots +\sqrt{t_n}B_{Q_n}^\circ.
  \end{equation}

