    \mathbb{E}_z(\overline{Z}_{{\rho}_1})  = x + 2 x^{\alpha}+ {\mathbf{c}}-\frac{1}{6}\frac{1}{x^{\alpha}}+o\Big(\frac{1}{x^{\alpha}}\Big), 
    \end{align}  
moreover, for any $\beta<1$,    






\begin{align} 
    \mathbb{E}_z(\overline{Z}_{\rho_1}^{\beta})  =& x^\beta+2\beta x^{\beta-1+ \alpha}+O(x^{\beta-1}).  


\end{align}

