[Lem 6 of arXiv:2606.17472, '2606.17472'] Assume that $\nu$ is a finite measure with compact support. Then the following convergence holds:
  \begin{align*}
  \int_\R h_q(X_t-y)\nu(dy)\to \int_\R h(X_t-y)\nu(dy)\qquad \text{a.s.\ and\ in\ }L^1(\P_x).
\end{align*}

