[Lemma lemma_exit_upperbd2 of arXiv:2603.29442, 'A compact support property for infinite-dimensional SDEs with Hölder continuous coefficien'] There are constants $c_4, c_5 > 0$ such that for sufficiently small $\zeta$, for all $\delta \in (0,1]$, $n \in \mathbb{N}_0$ and $\mathbb{P}_{a_n} \in \mathscr{M}_{\gamma,\delta}(a_n)$,
\begin{equation}
\mathbb{P}_{a_n} (\tau_{a_{n-1}} < \tau_{a_{n+1}} ) \leq \frac 1 3 + \zeta^{c_4} \cdot e^{-c_5 n}.
\end{equation}

