[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2506.15159, 'Conditional central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] Under the same assumption as in \cref{lemmaB3},
for any graph $K$ with $v\geq 4$ vertices, we
have 
\begin{equation}

  \begin{aligned}
    \E \t K=O(n^{v-2}+n^{v/2+1/2}).
  \end{aligned}
\end{equation}

