[Thm 20 of arXiv:2609.03819, 'Stochastic damped wave and Euler-Bernoulli equations with singular locally H\"older contin'] Assume that assumptions \ref{H0}, \ref{H0.5}, \ref{H1}, \ref{H2b}, \ref{H3} and conditions
