Let $N_0$ be as in the statement of Proposition (KMT of the paper) for $A = 2M$, $\epsilon = \eta/4$ and $p$ as in the statement of the present lemma. From Proposition (KMT of the paper) ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:f6fb573ae0d47cdcfc610bb0938fff98a632fb1898b8e53c780dbf24effeb116","revision_digest":"sha256:3acf516af721d45736fa4ae19c06189acefe42bab0acfee3f2637365b0bef53f","source_id":"arxiv:2410.23899","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

