        \leq  \left(\prod_{x\in \Lambda'}\exp(\tilde{C} A(x, \Lambda_i, \lambda, \xi)^2)\right) \mathrm{d} \nu_{\Lambda', 0, \rho_{\frac{a}{2}}}^{0} [\psi].
