	T_x(y) = \ov\zeta(x,y) = \frac{x+\nabla \ov{u}(x)}{2} +  \frac{y-\nabla \ov{u}(y)}{2} = \nabla_y \bigg(\Big\langle  \frac{x+\nabla \ov{u}(x)}{2} ,y \Big\rangle +  \frac{1}{2}\bigg( \frac{\abs{y}^2}{2}  - \ov{u}(y)\bigg) \bigg).
