[Lem 9 of arXiv:2510.22783, 'Universality of Cutoff for Riffle Shuffling'] For $K=O(\log N)$, let $Y_x$ denote the number of strings with prefix $x$ in $S_K$. If $\mathbb EY_x\leq N^q$, then
        \begin{equation}
            \mathbb P(Y_x\geq 3N^q)\leq \exp(-cN^q).
        \end{equation}

[Lemma lem:N1 of arXiv:2609.04092, 'Short character sums of inhomogeneous polynomials'] Let $(s_1,...,s_{k-1})\in \{1,2\}^{k-1}$ where $s_i=1$ for $1\leq i \leq k-(I+1)$ and $s_i=2$ for $k-I\leq i \leq k-1$.  Suppose $S(\alpha)\gg_n L_2^n L_1^{n-\delta}$ for some $\delta>0$. Then 
    \begin{align*}
        N(4L_{s_1},...,4L_{s_{k-1}};L_1^{-1}) \gg_n  (\prod_{i=1}^{k-1}L_{s_i}^n) L_1^{-2^{k-1}\delta} (\log L_1)^{-n}.
    \end{align*}

