\(
    m_{\xi,d,+}=\max\{m_{\xi,d},0\}.
\)
Set
\[
    F_{\xi,d}^{\mathrm{pre}}
    =
    \sum_{\ell=0}^{m_{\xi,d,+}-1}
    \sum_{I\in\mathcal D_\ell([0,1])}
    \sum_{\substack{
        J\in\mathcal D_{\ell+1}([0,1])\\
        J\subset I
    }}
    c_J(\xi,d,\ell)M_I(U_J-1),
\]
and, for every integer \(L\ge1\),
\[
    F_{\xi,d,L}^{\mathrm{post}}
    =
    \sum_{\ell=m_{\xi,d,+}}^{L-1}
    \sum_{I\in\mathcal D_\ell([0,1])}
    \sum_{\substack{
        J\in\mathcal D_{\ell+1}([0,1])\\
        J\subset I
    }}
    c_J(\xi,d,\ell)M_I(U_J-1),
\]
with the convention that the sum is \(0\) when \(L\le m_{\xi,d,+}\).

Whenever the limit exists, define
\(
    F_{\xi,d}^{\mathrm{post}}
    =
