[Theorem 16 of arXiv:2606.21111, 'On Elephant Random Walk with Delayed Amnesia'] Let $0\le p<(4a-1)/4a$. Then,
\begin{equation*}
\mathbb{E}(S_n^2)\sim \frac{n}{(2a(1-p)-1)^2}\Big(\frac{(a(2p-1))^2}{4a(1-p)-1}+\frac{(1-2p)(a-1)}{1-p}+(a-1)^2\Big),\ \ \text{as} \ n\to\infty.
\end{equation*}

