[Lemma lem:convex of arXiv:2511.05223, 'Kac's Program and Relative Entropy Decay for Nonlinear Spin-Exchange Dynamics'] For any nonnegative symmetric function $F$, for all $i\in[K]$, one has
  \begin{equation}
  {\ensuremath{\mathbb E}} \left[\varrho_1\left[{\rm Ent}_{\varrho_{1,i}}F\right]\right]\le \nu\left[{\rm Ent}_{\nu_i} F \right]\,.
\end{equation}

