        \norm{\overline P_sf}\leq \frac{2C}{s}\norm{f} + \frac{B}{s}\norm{f}\qquad\text{for all }s>0\,,
    \end{align*}
    so that $\norm{\overline P_s}_{L_0^2(\mu)\to L_0^2(\mu)}\leq\frac{1}{e}$ for all $s\geq","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:b7eb0ea8b6da164400b87f9fcb9c9254c235b00b8e31ee7d71d7d8d596a443b9","revision_digest":"sha256:430133a02cc491a47028c78c7b7b79ba1727daf8440cadfd7876a1f824f231ff","source_id":"arxiv:2607.10801","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

