[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2609.02699, '\vspace{-0.5 cm}Gauge theory and symplectic structures'] The following diagrams commute.
\begin{align*}
  \begin{tikzcd}
    \Lambda^4(M)\arrow{r}{i *}\arrow[swap]{d}{c}&i\Lambda^2(M)\arrow{d}{c}&&\Lambda^4(M)\arrow{r}{i *}\arrow[swap]{d}{c}&i\Lambda^2(M)\arrow{d}{c}\\
