\big|\mathbf{N}(\lambda) - c_\gamma \lambda\mu_\ph(\Sigma)\big| = o ( \lambda^{1/2} \log \lambda),
\end{equation}
say, in probability (the left hand side, divided by $\lambda^{1/2} \log \lambda$, tends to zero in probability). (Stated as a problem by the paper; open unless the paper says otherwise.)

