[Proposition 22 (Giant-component degree moments) of arXiv:2609.01143, 'The voter model on the hyperbolic graph'] For every fixed $\alpha\in(1/2,1)$, $\nu>0$, and $q\in\mathbb R$, when $q>2\alpha$
\[
M_q \pasymp n^{q/(2\alpha)}
\]
and otherwise
