	Indeed, Lemma (exponential-estimate-lemma1 of the paper), Lemma (exponential-estimate-lemma2 of the paper), and Aubin-Lions lemma imply the exponential tightness of $\{\mu_{\varepsilon,\delta(\varepsilon)}\}$ in $ L^2([0,T];H^{\alpha-2\beta}(\mathbb{T}^2)). $ The exponential tightness in  ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:ae81f8831c5d53c0d7d5957177e86d6dda42ed9bc83d12be24e7fcdaa8dd6368","revision_digest":"sha256:46b0920ae2c5be0cce92624e3b83ef752decfbd8471694bf12261887e500e7a4","source_id":"arxiv:2411.04500","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

