body:
[Prop gamma-recursion of arXiv:2608.13154, 'Extreme principal minors of Wishart and deformed GOE matrices'] Assume that \(a>2\). Then $\gamma_1(a)=\sqrt a$,
and, for every \(m\ge2\),
\begin{equation}
 \gamma_m(a)
 =
 \max_{0\le t\le1}
 \left\{
 t\gamma_{m-1}(a)
 +
 \sqrt{(1-t)\bigl(a(1-t)+4t\bigr)}
 \,
 \right\}.
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

