[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] For all $\mathbf{X} = (X,\bbx) \in P^{\alpha}([0,T],V)$ we have
\begin{align*}
\| X \|_{\infty} + \| \bbx \|_{\infty} \leq ( 1 + T^{\alpha} + T^{2 \alpha} ) | \mathbf{X} |_{\alpha}.
\end{align*}

