body:
[Proposition prop:34 of arXiv:2504.12293, 'Near-existence of bigeodesics in dynamical exponential last passage percolation'] There exist constants $C,c_1,c_2$ such that for all $n$ and all $j,k,i,\Delta\in [\![-2\varepsilon n^{1/3},2\varepsilon n^{1/3}]\!]$ additionally satisfying $i\not\in A_{\Delta}$, we have 
  \begin{equation}

    |\mathrm{Cov}(T_{u_{j}}^{v_k}, T_{u_{j+i}}^{v_{k+\Delta+i}})|\leq Cn^{2/3} \min(e^{-c_1\Delta^2},e^{-c_2\min_{a\in A_{\Delta}}|i-a|^3}).
  \end{equation}

