when $|\mathrm{Im}(\xi)| < K^{-1}$. 
Define $\rho(z) = \|r\|_{\mu}^{-1}\varphi\big(4z/(\pi\,K) \big)$, which is analytic in the strip $|\mathrm{Im}(z)| < \pi/4$ and bounded by $e$. 
