[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2604.19308, '\textbf{On McKean--Vlasov SDEs with polynomial drifts for SIS epidemic models}'] For $a,b,c\in\R$ and $y\geq 0$ we have
\begin{equation*}
\max_{x\in [0,y]} a + bx + cx^{2} = 
\begin{cases}
a - \frac{(b^{+})^{2}}{4c} & \text{if $c < 0$ and $b < -2cy$}\\
a + by + cy^{2}& \text{if $c < 0$ and $b\geq -2 cy$}\\
a + (b + cy)^{+}y & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
.
\end{equation*}

