[Cor 14 of arXiv:2608.21255, 'Laws of the iterated logarithm for random Dirichlet series with general weights'] Assume that $\eta$ has a standard normal distribution. Then
\begin{equation}
    \log\Big|1+\frac{Z_n}{Y_n}\Big|=o(1)\quad n\to\infty\quad \text{{\rm a.s.}}
\end{equation}

