body:
[Proposition 18 of arXiv:2608.26001, 'The kernel of the Birman--Craggs--Johnson homomorphism'] Fix $g \geq 3$.  The following hold:
\begin{itemize}
\item The group $\QK_g^1$ is an elementary abelian $2$-group.
\item The action of $\Mod_g^1$ on $\QK_g^1$ factors through an action
of $\Sp_{2g}(\Z)$.
\end{itemize}

