[Lemma lem:PoissonSum of arXiv:2601.19630, 'Mass generation for the two dimensional O(N) Linear Sigma Model in the large N limit'] For $m>0$, the following identity holds
\begin{equation}
\sum_{k \in \mathbb{Z}^{2}}\frac{m^{2}}{(m^{2}L^{2}+|2\pi k|^{2} )^{2} }=\int_{0}^{\infty}e^{-sL^{2}}\sum_{k \in \mathbb{Z}^{2}} \frac{1}{4 \pi } e^{-\frac{m^{2}}{4s}|k|^{2}}ds.
\end{equation}

