\mathbb W_2^{\mathscr C_\infty}(P^{\ast}_t\mu_0,P^{\ast}_t\nu_0)\leq c\text{\rm{e}}^{-\lambda t}\mathbb W_2^{\mathscr C_\infty}(\mu_0,\nu_0),\ \ t\geq 0, \mu_0,\nu_0\in \mathscr P_{2}(\mathscr C_\infty).
