\mathbf{E}_{\Omega_0^{\varepsilon,\delta}=\Omega_0}\int_0^{t\wedge \tau^{\varepsilon,\delta}}\Pi_{\mathcal{Z}}(K; \Omega_s^{\varepsilon,\delta})ds \rightarrow \mathbf{E}_{Z_0=\pi(\Omega_0)}\int_0^{t\wedge \tau}\overline{\Pi}_{\mathcal{Z}}(K; Z_s)ds \ .
