[Proposition proplt of arXiv:2412.04334, 'Fractional counting process at L\'{e}vy times and its applications'] The LT of the TCFCP $Z(t,\lambda _{\theta }),\;t\geq 0$ is denoted by $\mathcal{L}(s,t)$, is given as
    \begin{equation}
        \mathcal{L}(s,t) = \mathit{\Gamma } ( \vartheta )\sum_{m=0}^{\infty}\frac{(\zeta )_m(\lambda_{\theta}(e^{-s}-1))^m}{m!\mathit{\Gamma } (\mu m+ \vartheta )}\mathbb{E}\left[(H(t))^{m\theta}\right].
    \end{equation}

