[Lemma lem: more refined R_2 estimate of arXiv:2603.10738, 'Pairwise Negative Correlation for Uniform Spanning\\ Subgraphs of the Complete Graph'] For $R_2$, 	we have the following asymptotic behavior:
		\begin{align}
		R_2
		&=3\sqrt{2\pi}\,n^{\,n+\frac{3k}{2}-3}
		\Bigg\{
		\frac{3(k-1)(3k-1)\chi_{k-1}}{2^{\frac{3k+1}{2}}\Gamma\!\left(\frac{3k+1}{2}\right)}\nonumber
		\\
		&\qquad\qquad
		+\frac{(3k-4)(3k-2)}{2^{\frac{3k}{2}}\Gamma\!\left(\frac{3k}{2}\right)}
		\Bigg((k-1)\chi_{k-1}+\tilde{\chi}_{k-1}-\frac{3}{2}(k-2)\chi_{k-2}\Bigg)\,n^{-\frac12}
		+O(n^{-1})
		\Bigg\}.
		\end{align}.

