[Proposition 51 of arXiv:2608.09700, 'A general paracontrolled ansatz for singular SPDEs'] If a function $u$ verifies the paracontrolled ansatz of \eqref{eq_gPAM} up to order $\gamma$ given below
		\begin{equation*}
			\begin{aligned}
			u=\sum_{\tau\in\mcT} \P ( u_\tau , \, Z_{\mcI(\tau)} ) + u^\#,
	\end{aligned}
			\end{equation*}
				with $u^\#\in C^\gamma$.
		 Then $u$ can be be developed in the  paracontrolled system associated with \eqref{eq_gPAM} up to order $\gamma$, as defined in Definition \ref{def_PAMparacSystem}.

