[Prop 8 of arXiv:2606.05964, 'Strong Solutions to SDEs with Supercritical Drift arising in Navigation Models'] Let $\mu_1,\mu_2$ as in \eqref{eq_pn}. 
There exists $M_0$ such that, on $H^1_m \cap L^1_{0,\ve, m}$,
for all $m \geq M_0$, $\tau \leq \tau_{\frac 1m} + \frac{4}{mv}$, and moreover
\begin{equation}
\limsup_{t\nearrow \tau}  \sup_{s\geq t} |\T_s|  \leq  m^{-\frac 14}.
\end{equation}

