Recall that on $J_{0,m}$,
$\Theta_{\tau_{\frac 1m}} \in \left] -\pim + \tfrac{m^{-\frac 14}}{2}, \pim-\tfrac{m^{-\frac 14}}{2}\right[$.

\medskip
\noindent\textit{Bootstrap setup.}
We first set
\begin{equation}
\tau^{*} := \tau \wedge \left(\tau_{\frac 1m} + \frac{4}{mv}\right),
