[Lemma lem:LowerOrderTerm of arXiv:2410.23915, 'Asymptotic Bounds and Online Algorithms for Average-Case Matrix Discrepancy'] Let $\delta = \gamma2e^{-3/4}\sqrt{m}4^{-\xi n/m^2}$ for some constant $\gamma > 1$.
        \begin{enumerate}[label=(\alph*)]
            \item In the setting $\omega(1) = m^2 = o(n)$, we have
