    For any event $\calE$ (and in particular, for the event $\calE$ defined in [HMP24]), we have:
    \begin{align*}
        \Pr\left[ \opnorm{\Cov(\mu_{H_{N, t}})} \ge K \right] \le \Pr\left[ \opnorm{\Cov(\mu_{H_{N, t}})} \ge K \land \calE_{\iota} \land \calE \right] + \Pr\bracks*{\ol{\calE}} + \Pr\bracks*{\ol{\calE_{\iota}}} \mper
    \end{align*}
    The desired statement follows by observing that $\Pr\bracks*{\ol{\calE_{\iota}}} \le e^{-cN}$ by [HMP24], $\Pr\bracks*{\ol{\calE}} \le e^{-cN}$ by [HMP24], and applying [HMP24] with $X = ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:dcfac66bde4b3d3a93651e576c6e8cc626193eaf5084f3eae8d09b05808d7636","revision_digest":"sha256:5580ad79ecc498b4947496ca52468931350d4688a603003553b04565400f69e4","source_id":"arxiv:2411.09075","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

