    \sup_{x\in\mathbb{R}^2,\,\epsilon>0}\mathbb{E}[\exp(c(\beta_t^\epsilon(B_t^{x,x})-\mathbb{E}[\beta_t^\epsilon(B_t^{x,x})])]<\infty.
