[Lemma energyestimate of arXiv:2601.21762, 'Navier-Stokes with a fractional transport noise as a limit of multi-scale dynamics'] The following energy estimate holds for the solutions, uniformly in $\epsilon$:
    \begin{equation}

                \sup_{t\leq T}\norm{u^{\epsilon}_{t}}_{H}^{2} + \int_{0}^{T} \norm{\nabla u^{\epsilon}_{r}}_{H}^{2}dr 
            \leq C(\nu) \norm{u^{\epsilon}_{0}}_{H}^{2}.
    \end{equation}

