    \begin{align*}
        \liminf_{n \to \infty}\Prob{\tau\leq \epsilon \sqrt{n}}=O(\epsilon^2),
    \end{align*}
    where the $O(\cdot)$ term on the right-hand side above is as $\epsilon\to 0$.

