[Proposition prop:QLcirc of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] For all $L\in Gl(V)$, we have
\begin{equation}
  (Q\circ L)^\circ=Q^{\circ}\circ L^{-T}
\end{equation}
were $L^{-T}$ is the inverse of the transpose $L^T$ (recall its definition in (equation def:LT of the paper)).

