[Corollary cor:sumoverUh of arXiv:2411.10829, 'Airy$_\beta$ line ensemble and its Laplace transform'] For any $h'\ge 0$, we have
\begin{multline}  
\sum_{\vec r\in\mathscr B^{{h'}}_+}\prod_{j\in J_\mathrm I} \frac{|U|+\vartheta_j\max_t \mathscr{H}(t)}{N} |w(\vec r)|<C\prod_{\ell=1}^m(2\sqrt{NN_\ell})^{k_\ell} N^{-|J| -\frac{1}{3}(|J_\mathrm {VI.2}|+\max\{|J_\mathrm {VI.1}|, |J_\mathrm {VI.3}|\}+|J_\mathrm C|)} \\ \times    \exp(-c{h'}^2)
\prod_{j\in J_\mathrm I} \frac{\vartheta_j^{-1/2} }{N^{1/3}}
\prod_{j\in J_\mathrm {IV},\vartheta_j\ne \varnothing} \frac{\vartheta_j^{-3/2} }{N^{1/3}}
\prod_{j\in J_\mathrm {IV},\vartheta_j=\varnothing} \frac{1}{N^{2/3}}
\prod_{j\in J_\mathrm {III}\cup J_\mathrm {VI.1}\cup J_\mathrm {VI.2}\cup J_\mathrm {VI.3}} \vartheta_j^{-3/2}.
\end{multline}
There is an extra factor of $N^{-1/3}$ or $(y-x)^{-1/2}$ in the right-hand side, under the condition (i) or (ii), respectively, specified in (prop:mbdc2 of the paper).

