[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2605.16868, '\ttl'] We have 
\begin{equation*}
\frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^N \E \sup_{0 \le t \le T} \left|\bar{X}^N_i(t) -\breve{X}^N_i(t)\right| \le \frac{2T^\frac{1}{2}}{N^{\alpha/2}}\sqrt{\|\lambda^N\|_1 + 2\|\mu^N\|_1} \,\,.
\end{equation*}
Hence, 
\begin{equation*}
\frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^N \E \sup_{0 \le t \le T} \left|\bar{Q}^N_i(t) -\breve{Q}^N_i(t)\right| \le \frac{CT^\frac{1}{2}}{N^{\alpha/2}}\sqrt{\|\lambda^N\|_1 + 2\|\mu^N\|_1}
\end{equation*}for some constant $C>0$.

