[Proposition prop:type-I-generating-function of arXiv:2609.01920, 'Isospectral and not strongly isospectral spherical space forms with non-cyclic fundamental'] Let $\Gamma=\Gamma_2(m,4,m-1)$ and  $\rho=\rho_{k_1}\oplus\cdots\oplus\rho_{k_p}$, for some integers $m,k_1,\dots,k_p$ satisfying $m>0$, $m\equiv 1\pmod2$, and $\gcd(m,k_j)=1$ for all $j$. 
Then
\begin{equation}
F_{\rho(\Gamma)}(z)
= \frac{1}{4} \Big(F_{L_\rho}(z)+F_{L_\rho}(-z)\Big) + \frac{1-z^2}{2(1+z^2)^{2p}}.
	\end{equation}

